        If the dimension is composite (SPEED, ACCELERATION, FORCE),
        returns 0 (no net exponent).
        If it is a base dimension (LENGTH, MASS, TIME), returns its exponent.
        """
        if self in (Dimension.LENGTH, Dimension.MASS, Dimension.TIME):
